{"id":"tesoro","lemma":"tesoro","pos":"noun","rank":1438,"glosses":["treasure, trove, treasure trove","thesaurus","treasury, exchequer (sometimes capitalized)"],"ipa":"/teˈsoɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tesoros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-tesoro.wav","examples":[{"text":"El silencio es un tesoro.","en":"Silence is golden.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444461","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"silence"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Esta pelota es el tesoro de aquel niño.","en":"This ball is that boy's treasure.","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"ball"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that (over there"},{"g":"child, boy"}]},{"text":"Pocos tesoros son tan valiosos como un amigo.","en":"Few treasures are worth as much as a friend.","words":[{"g":"little, not much","l":"poco"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"so, as"},{"g":"valuable","l":"valioso"},{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"friend"}]},{"text":"La basura de un hombre es el tesoro de otro.","en":"One man's meat is another man's poison.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586776","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"trash"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"someone else"}]},{"text":"Tom dejó de buscar el tesoro y volvió a casa.","en":"Tom stopped looking for the treasure and went back home.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/802042","words":[null,{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to seek"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to return","l":"volver"},null,null],"phrases":[[8,10,"home"]]}]}